TYPE UDT_PusherIO
  ROOTID 0
  MEMBERS
    Step : Int
    Fitted : Bool
    Enable : Bool COMMENT "Internal permissive (Fitted AND Mode <> 0) gating this pusher's own cycle acceptance - not the C-115 chain-enable vocabulary. See AutoStartSignal below for that; two same-family names, different concepts (this one predates the site's chained-permissive naming, added 2026-07-17 alongside it - not renamed, to avoid touching a proven interface member just to apply a doc-06 rule)."
    AutoStartSignal : Bool COMMENT "C-115 handshake vocabulary (enable in), added 2026-07-17 owner ruling (C-5) - every equipment FB carries this, stepped or not, even where the caller has nothing to wire it from yet. Unwired by FC_ControlMain for now; distinct from Enable above."
    Mode : Int
    HopperHighLevel : Bool
    ManualCycleCmd : Bool
    ParkCmd : Bool COMMENT "In (FC_ControlMain, from the sequencer's PusherParkCmd): plant pre-start park request - while set, an idle off-home ram reparks to home after the pre-motion warning (REQ-045). With a live cycle request, one of the only two repark occasions (owner ruling 2026-07-16); jog release deliberately leaves the ram where it stopped (REQ-039)."
    CycleInhibit : Bool COMMENT "In (FC_ControlMain, from the sequencer's PusherCycleInhibitCmd): the plant has a live stop reason - no cycle may launch (CycleRequest gated) and an in-flight cycle aborts to Retract and parks (CycleAbort). Hand-jog is deliberately exempt (owner amendment 2026-07-16, REQ-040): only the mode-0 force (stop button/unhealthy) blocks jogging."
    JogExtendCmd : Bool
    JogRetractCmd : Bool
    HomeLimit : Bool
    FullTravelLimit : Bool
    HighPressure : Bool
    PowerPackRunningFB : Bool
    FaultReset : Bool
    EndTravelTimeout : Real
    ParkedTimeout : Real
    EndTravelHoldTime : Real
    PumpRunOnTime : Real
    JogWarningTime : Real
    PressureTripConfirmTime : Real
    PressureClearResumeDelay : Real
    PressureTripCountThreshold : Int
    Cycling : Bool
    UPSEnable : Bool COMMENT "C-115 handshake vocabulary (ready out), added 2026-07-17 owner ruling (C-5) - what a downstream instance would chain off, per the site's admitted chained-permissive-enable pattern. Unwired by FC_ControlMain for now (this pusher has nothing downstream of it in the material chain)."
    Run : Bool COMMENT "C-115 handshake vocabulary (running out), added 2026-07-17 owner ruling (C-5) - the site's real member name for this concept (patterns/motor-dol, patterns/chained-permissive-enable), not doc 06's illustrative 'running'. Unwired by FC_ControlMain for now; distinct from Cycling above (Cycling is this block's own in-cycle status, not the site's standard handshake name)."
    Blocked : Bool
    EndTravelTimeoutFault : Bool
    ParkedTimeoutFault : Bool
    BothSwitchesFault : Bool
    RunPowerPack : Bool
    Extend : Bool
    Retract : Bool
    JogPreStartSounder : Bool
